# 🛑 Daily Shutdown

Stop application containers:

```bash
docker stop \
  catalog-service \
  inventory-service \
  notification-service \
  auth-service \
  order-service \
  payment-service \
  analytics-service \
  frontend
```

PostgreSQL can remain running.

If required:

```bash
sudo systemctl stop postgresql
```

